# Testing-deploy vs customer production

**Test-deploy:** yes (`bash start.sh`). **Customer production:** **NO** — inbound unproven on customer host, restore drill untested on customer host, SAMYOJ-35 TARGET subscriptions, live transfer stub. Do not rewrite AUTH unless the user asks.

## Workers

Embedded in the API (`startWorkers()` in `server/src/index.ts`). PM2 runs **whatsapp-api only**. `npm run start:worker` / `dev:worker` must **exit 1**. Do not start PM2 `whatsapp-worker`.

